%%Title: Ten Boats Home, page 13: higher
/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 113 def } ifelse  Seed srand
(lib/cb_book.ps) run
cb-ground
/night cb-light
260 cb-harbour-sky
-9 440 200 60 cb-pier
0 600 0.9 cb-fog
330 200 150 cb-mama
% the same place, on tiptoe, arms straight up: the biggest light in the book
/cb-arm /up def /cb-lamp true def /cb-lit true def /cb-glowr 2.6 def
400 208 104 cb-ana
/cb-arm /down def /cb-lamp false def /cb-lit false def /cb-glowr 0.8 def
cb-paper cb-rgb
cb-fontit findfont 34 scalefont setfont (So she holds it higher.) 306 548 showctr
/cb-foliorgb cb-paper def 13 cb-folio
showpage
